# Drag-Adjust Numeric Input

Use `DragSpinBox` / `DragDoubleSpinBox` (`cpp/src/app/widgets/drag_spin_box.*`) — `NoButtons`, horizontal drag scrub.
Shift ×10, Ctrl ×100 where implemented. No raw `QSpinBox` in new settings UI unless owner asks.
